    "sections": {
        "description": "Beauty Cosmetics Lite Theme provides a responsive layout for creating a website centered on beauty, cosmetics, products, services, and related content. Its homepage can organize featured images, service details, product information, promotional content, and recent posts into clearly defined sections. The responsive design adjusts the layout for desktops, tablets, and mobile screens. A Cosmetics Store can use product-focused sections to present categories, descriptions, images, and other shopping information in an organized manner. A Beauty Salon can arrange service details, contact information, and appointment-related content across dedicated sections. The Beauty Cosmetics Lite theme also provides layouts suitable for a Makeup Artist who wants to present work samples, service information, and updates. A Skincare Brand can use image-based sections to introduce products and share educational content. Blog functionality provides space for a Beauty Blogger to publish tutorials, routines, product information, and beauty-related articles. A Cosmetic Shop or Makeup Store can organize products and categories while maintaining consistent navigation throughout the site. Customizable sections, menu options, social links, and structured content areas provide flexibility for different website layouts."
    },
